cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, please cite this repository.
title: Reproducible Sparse-Concept and Calibration Diagnostics for Knowledge Tracing
abstract: A reproducible protocol and calibration diagnostic for sparse knowledge components in Knowledge Tracing, with train-only strata, occupancy-aware reporting, ECE/Brier, reliability diagrams, L1-L7 leakage control, and a frozen table rebuild.
type: software
license: MIT
keywords:
  - knowledge tracing
  - calibration
  - sparse concepts
  - educational data mining
  - reproducibility
